# Herbal Tracker+ — release signing configuration.
#
# Copy this file to android/key.properties and fill in the values for your
# release keystore. The real key.properties is gitignored and must NEVER be
# committed. Never put a keystore (.jks/.keystore) or any password in the repo.
#
# In CI, the workflow writes this file from repository secrets instead.
#
# Properties (all four required for a release build):
keystore=kratomtracker-plus.jks
storePassword=__REPLACE__
keyPassword=__REPLACE__
keyAlias=kratomtracker-plus
#
# `keystore` may be an absolute path or relative to android/app/. For a
# keystore kept outside the repo (recommended), use an absolute path, e.g.:
#   keystore=/home/you/.android-keystores/kratomtracker-plus.jks
#
# Alternatively, set the environment variable KRATOM_KEYSTORE_PROPERTIES to the
# absolute path of a properties file with these four keys, and leave
# android/key.properties absent.
